stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> VERIFIED
  VERIFIED --> DIRTY: source_glob/db_object changed
  VERIFIED --> STALE: live E2E fails or edge fingerprint changed
  DIRTY --> VERIFIED: replay + evidence refreshed
  DIRTY --> STALE: validation fails
  STALE --> VERIFIED: fix + successful replay
  VERIFIED --> PARTIAL: evidence source unavailable
  PARTIAL --> VERIFIED: evidence completed
